<script lang="ts">import {getContext} from 'svelte';import {page} from '$app/state';import type {I18nState} from '../../../../../lib/i18n/i18n.svelte';import {createBackordersState} from '../state/backordersState.svelte';const i18n=getContext<I18nState>('i18n');const selection=getContext<{warehouseId:number|null}>('warehouseSelection');const vm=createBackordersState();let reason=$state('other'),target=$state<number|null>(null);$effect(()=>{const w=selection?.warehouseId,t=vm.tab;void vm.load(w??null,t);});async function cancel(){if(target!==null&&await vm.cancel(target,reason,selection?.warehouseId??null))target=null;}</script>
<section class="page"><header><div><p class="eyebrow">ABELLIS · SMART WMS</p><h1>{i18n.t('Pedidos pendientes')}</h1><p>{i18n.t('Controla pedidos bloqueados por falta de existencias y los que ya pueden despacharse.')}</p></div></header>
<div class="tabs"><button class:active={vm.tab==='waiting'} onclick={()=>void vm.load(selection?.warehouseId??null,'waiting')}>{i18n.t('Pendientes de inventario')}</button><button class:active={vm.tab==='ready-to-ship'} onclick={()=>void vm.load(selection?.warehouseId??null,'ready-to-ship')}>{i18n.t('Listos para despacho')}</button></div>
{#if vm.error}<p class="error" role="alert">{vm.error}</p>{/if}{#if target!==null}<div class="cancel"><label>{i18n.t('Motivo de cancelación')}<select bind:value={reason}><option value="other">{i18n.t('Otro')}</option><option value="found">{i18n.t('Existencias encontradas')}</option><option value="customer_asked">{i18n.t('Solicitado por cliente')}</option><option value="refunded">{i18n.t('Reembolsado')}</option><option value="parent_cancelled">{i18n.t('Pedido original cancelado')}</option></select></label><button onclick={()=>target=null}>{i18n.t('Volver')}</button><button class="danger" disabled={vm.saving} onclick={()=>void cancel()}>{i18n.t('Confirmar cancelación')}</button></div>{/if}
{#if vm.loading}<p>{i18n.t('Cargando…')}</p>{:else if vm.rows.length===0}<p class="empty">{i18n.t('No hay pedidos en esta cola.')}</p>{:else}<div class="cards">{#each vm.rows as r (r.salesOrderId)}<article><div class="card-head"><div><strong>{r.salesOrderNumber}</strong><span>{i18n.t('Pedido original')}: {r.parentSalesOrderNumber||'—'}</span></div><span class="status">{r.status}</span></div><p>{r.customerName??'—'} · {r.daysWaiting} {i18n.t('días pendientes')}</p><div class="items">{#each r.items as item,i}<div><span>{item.sku} · {item.itemName}</span><b>× {item.quantity}</b>{#if item.openPurchaseOrder}<small>{i18n.t('Compra abierta')}: {item.openPurchaseOrder.purchaseOrderNumber} · {item.openPurchaseOrder.quantityRemaining}</small>{:else}<small>{i18n.t('Sin orden de compra abierta')}</small>{/if}</div>{/each}</div>{#if vm.tab==='waiting'}<button class="danger" onclick={()=>target=r.salesOrderId}>{i18n.t('Cancelar pedido pendiente')}</button>{:else}<span class="ready">{i18n.t('Disponible para despacho')}</span>{/if}</article>{/each}</div>{/if}</section>
<style>.page{max-width:78rem;margin:1.4rem auto;padding:0 1.1rem;color:var(--ink)}header{margin-bottom:1rem}h1{margin:0;font:700 1.6rem var(--disp)}header p{color:var(--slate);font-size:.9rem}.eyebrow{font:600 .65rem var(--disp);letter-spacing:.14em}.tabs{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin:1rem 0}.tabs button,.cancel button{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:.55rem .8rem;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.tabs button.active{background:var(--navy);color:white}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(290px,1fr));gap:.8rem}.cards article,.cancel{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card)}.card-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.7rem}.card-head div{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.card-head strong{font:700 1.05rem var(--disp)}.card-head span,.cards p,.items small{color:var(--slate);font-size:.8rem}.status{font-size:.72rem}.items{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:.8rem 0}.items div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.3rem;padding:.55rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.82rem}.items small{grid-column:1/-1}.danger,.error{color:var(--danger)}.ready{color:var(--success);font-size:.82rem}.cancel{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:.6rem;margin:1rem 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.cancel label{display:grid;gap:.3rem;color:var(--slate);font-size:.8rem}.cancel select{min-height:39px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:.5rem;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink)}.empty{color:var(--slate);padding:2rem 0}</style>